{"2794600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes of the Unread", "steam_appid": 2794600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of the Unread</strong> is a musical 8-bit odyssey that celebrates the magic of stories. You play as Rhapsody, a student who falls asleep in the library during a late-night study session, only to wake up in a world where the shelves have come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find her way back to reality, Rhapsody must travel through the pages of different book genres, using the only tool she has left: her voice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794600/extras/07b12c6efd1410f089dc82c59f71c60e.avif?t=1781865758\" width=1200 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure, music is more than just sound—it’s a tool for discovery. Singing allows you to solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden secrets, and interact with the world in unexpected ways. Watch as the environment reacts to your melodies, opening new paths and revealing the library’s deepest mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794600/extras/13085891b38bc4b991b5aff9e4619987.avif?t=1781865758\" width=1200 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the pages of living stories. Each world you explore is inspired by a different literary genre, offering unique visuals and atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Wander through sandswept frontier towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Navigate a haunting graveyard filled with restless spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Dive into watery realms and serenade the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794600/extras/4bb0fcf4d54d63c4ea1d0f9057ef4283.avif?t=1781865758\" width=1200 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect lost pages and delve deeper into the library, Rhapsody’s musical prowess grows. Unlock new abilities that improve your platforming and puzzle-solving skills, allowing you to reach previously inaccessible areas and outsmart the wicked magician Odele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794600/extras/fbc38d900b0f7997b405c2181b11fe2c.avif?t=1781865758\" width=1200 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a successful NES Kickstarter, <i>Echoes of the Unread</i> is a true love letter to the 8-bit era. Experience a challenging, exploration-focused journey that stays faithful to the classic games we grew up with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Musical Interaction:</strong> Enemies and objects react uniquely to your singing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky Cast:</strong> Befriend a lonely cowboy, outsmart a mischievous ghost, and meet a variety of whimsical characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Puzzles &amp; Heavy Charm:</strong> A focus on exploration and thoughtful puzzles rather than just combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Imagination:</strong> A gentle, heartwarming tale about the power of getting lost in a good book.</p>", "about_the_game"