er way home from a library that doesn't want to let her go.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794600/3894c80dfb0716b69bfe8a96fae4dee4340261c9/header.jpg?t=1781865758", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794600/ddb92a7f1d6f5a778fc2ef5be11f32144c8291ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781865758", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794600/ddb92a7f1d6f5a778fc2ef5be11f32144c8291ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781865758", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 GHz Intel Core 2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 GHz Intel Core 2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL compatible video card with at least 512MB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Clever Cat Games"], "publishers": ["8 Bit Legit", "Mega Cat Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 2795520, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id